      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not comfortable with letting Vcn to determine the final capabilities of a mobile network. I think we should follow the add/remove capability pattern here. Also it\u0027s not very efficient if we need to call into Vcn manager every time.\n\nBetter to do something like this\n\nresult.setCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_NOT_VCN_MANAGED, !mVcnActive);\nand then update the cached mVcnActive in the policy listener you added below.\n\nAlso is that right to set *every* data connection including internet, mms, IMS, etc....with the same VCN capability?",
      "range": {
